  "bio": "Sebastian Grillo is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Bogotá, D.C., Colombia, who specializes in dotwork, black & gray, and illustrative styles. With a career that began in 2016, Sebastian has honed his craft to an exceptional level, creating intricate and striking designs from his private studio in Chapinero. Clients praise his artistry and the compelling visual stories that unfold within each tattoo he expertly inks onto their skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bogota, D.c., Colombia",
